  'ww.desc.wolf': 'Wolf side. Kills with the pack at night and passes as good by day.',
  'ww.desc.wolfKing': 'Wolf side; kills with the pack. When killed or voted out he may shoot someone; not when poisoned.',
  'ww.desc.whiteWolf': 'Wolf side; kills with the pack. By day, while people speak, he may blow himself up and take one player; night falls at once.',
  'ww.desc.wolfBeauty': 'Wolf side; kills with the pack. Charms one player a night (not the same twice running); when she dies, the charmed one dies with her.',
  'ww.desc.bigWolf': 'Wolf side; kills with the pack. Marks a prey each night; if the prey is voted out the next day, the pack kills two that night.',
  'ww.desc.hiddenWolf': 'Wolf side, but checks as good. Not in the pack and does not kill, until the pack is gone.',
  'ww.desc.gargoyle': "Wolf side. Sees one player's role each night. Not in the pack and does not kill, until the pack is gone.",
  'ww.desc.seer': 'Special role. Checks one player each night; the judge tells you privately whether they are a wolf.',
  'ww.desc.witch': 'Special role. One healing potion and one poison, each once a game, one a night. Sees who was attacked (not once the healing potion is gone); may save herself on the first night only.',
  'ww.desc.apothecary': "Special role, a second witch: one healing potion and one poison, each once, apart from the witch's.",
  'ww.desc.hunter': 'Special role. When killed or voted out he may shoot someone; not when poisoned.',
  'ww.desc.idiot': 'Special role. Voted out, he turns his card and stays, but can no longer vote; killed at night, he dies.',
  'ww.desc.guard': 'Special role. Guards one player each night (himself, or nobody, too); the guarded cannot be killed. Not the same player two nights running. Guarded and healed at once, one dies all the same.',
  'ww.desc.knight': 'Special role. Once a game, while people speak by day, he may duel a player: a wolf dies and night falls; a good one costs the knight his life and the day goes on.',
